      "text": "Currently, the use of smartphones, video games, and the widespread use of digital screens throughout the day have led to a new clinical syndrome named \"digital eye strain\". Few studies have examined problematic smartphone use, unlike screen-time duration, in relation to near binocular vision parameters. This study aimed to explore the association between near binocular vision and problematic smartphone use, using the smartphone addiction scale.",
