      "text": "In this perspective, we propose a cognitive-behavioral framework for conceptualizing and assessing patient-AI relationships in the OCRDs. We propose an assessment architecture that records the context of AI use and rates five functional domains: Emotional Reliance, Reassurance and Checking, Anthropomorphic Attribution, Epistemic Trust, and Displacement. We conclude by outlining a cognitive-behavioral approach to treatment planning for AI-facilitated reassurance seeking and discussing implications for safeguarding internal validity in research. We argue that structured inquiry into the patient-AI relationship belongs in OCRD assessment and research design, and we offer the present framework as a testable approach whose measurement properties remain to be established.",
