    {
      "text": "AlthoughBal et al. (2024)andDewi et al. InBal et al. Similarly,Dewi et al. Similarly,Twait et al. (2019),Zivan et al. (2019), andTwait et al. In contrast,Samson et al. D.et al. C.SantraA.et al. P.et al. J.et al. J.HowardW.GarrisonM.CorriganS.QuinataS.TaylorL.et al.",
      "paperTitle": "Passive and active screen time relate differently to attention in preschool children",
