      "text": "Assumptions for multivariate analysis including linearity, absence of multicollinearity, and multivariate normality were rigorously tested and met, ensuring the validity of the regression and results. Linearity between predictors and outcome variables was examined using scatterplots. The matrix shows a consistent pattern of statistically significant correlations (p< .01), indicating strong and meaningful associations among these variables. Before interpreting the regression coefficients, multicollinearity among predictors was evaluated using Variance Inflation Factor (VIF) and tolerance statistics. These results indicate that none of the predictors were excessively correlated, and the regression coefficients can be interpreted with confidence.",
