      "source": "openalex",
      "yearPublished": 2026,
      "chunk_index_in_doc": 85
    },
    {
      "text": "CFA factor loadings were consistent with EFA, and standard errors were low (0.03–0.05), suggesting precise estimates.Communalities (h2= 0.29–0.59) show that items adequately share variance with the underlying factor, and item-total correlations (0.42–0.62) further confirm each item’s contribution to the overall construct.",
