      "source": "openalex",
      "yearPublished": 2026,
      "chunk_index_in_doc": 88
    },
    {
      "text": "Clearly, these results reinforce the robustness of the scale, providing evidence that it reliably measures a single construct of assessment integrity among Ghanaian tertiary students.",
      "paperTitle": "Mental health and depression as mediators between social media use screen time and academic integrity among tertiary students in Ghana",
      "doi": "10.1038/s41598-026-40285-0",
      "source": "openalex",
      "yearPublished": 2026,
      "chunk_index_in_doc": 89
    },
    {
      "text": "Reliability, which refers to the consistency and stability of a measurement tool, was evaluated using internal consistency analysis.",
