      "source": "openalex",
      "yearPublished": 2026,
      "chunk_index_in_doc": 96
    },
    {
      "text": "Collectively, these results indicate that the instruments used in this study were reliable for use in a large-scale tertiary education context in Ghana.",
      "paperTitle": "Mental health and depression as mediators between social media use screen time and academic integrity among tertiary students in Ghana",
      "doi": "10.1038/s41598-026-40285-0",
      "source": "openalex",
      "yearPublished": 2026,
      "chunk_index_in_doc": 97
    },
    {
      "text": "In terms of validity, several approaches were employed to ensure the instruments measured what they were intended to measure.",
      "paperTitle": "Mental health and depression as mediators between social media use screen time and academic integrity among tertiary students in Ghana",
      "doi": "10.1038/s41598-026-40285-0",
