      "chunk_index_in_doc": 100
    },
    {
      "text": "These modifications ensured that the tools remained theoretically coherent while being contextually appropriate.Construct validity was reinforced by aligning the variables with well-established theoretical frameworks and prior empirical findings.",
      "paperTitle": "Mental health and depression as mediators between social media use screen time and academic integrity among tertiary students in Ghana",
