      "yearPublished": 2026,
      "chunk_index_in_doc": 106
    },
    {
      "text": "In all, the multi-pronged approach to ensuring both reliability and validity strengthened the methodological rigor of this study.",
      "paperTitle": "Mental health and depression as mediators between social media use screen time and academic integrity among tertiary students in Ghana",
