      "chunk_index_in_doc": 107
    },
    {
      "text": "The use of remote data collection is consistent with post-COVID-19 academic research practices, which have seen a significant shift toward virtual survey administration for reasons of safety, accessibility, and scalability41,50,62.",
      "paperTitle": "Mental health and depression as mediators between social media use screen time and academic integrity among tertiary students in Ghana",
