      "chunk_index_in_doc": 116
    },
    {
      "text": "To improve completion rates and reduce response fatigue, the questionnaire was segmented into thematic sections with progress indicators and minimal open-ended items.",
      "paperTitle": "Mental health and depression as mediators between social media use screen time and academic integrity among tertiary students in Ghana",
