      "chunk_index_in_doc": 118
    },
    {
      "text": "The research team also monitored the response rate in real time using Google Forms’ analytics tools to ensure regional representation and address underrepresented strata proactively.",
      "paperTitle": "Mental health and depression as mediators between social media use screen time and academic integrity among tertiary students in Ghana",
