      "doi": "10.5409/wjcp.v15.i1.111652",
      "source": "openalex",
      "yearPublished": 2026,
      "chunk_index_in_doc": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "However, this connection is found to be bidirectional, with both phenomena impacting each other.",
      "paperTitle": "Screen time in preschool-aged children and attention deficit hyperactivity disorder-related behaviors: A literature review",
