      "source": "openalex",
      "yearPublished": 2026,
      "chunk_index_in_doc": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "One study showed statistically significant longitudinal correlations between screen time at age three and inattention behaviors and hyperactivity/impulsivity behaviors at age four, but no concurrent association between screen time and either of these behaviors or scores at age three.",
