      "doi": "10.5409/wjcp.v15.i1.111652",
      "source": "openalex",
      "yearPublished": 2026,
      "chunk_index_in_doc": 2
    },
    {
      "text": "Crucially, screen usage beyond the two-hours mark was linked to a higher risk of externalizing morbidity that is clinically significant, particularly inattention issues.",
