bous H, et al. pmid:40047899View ArticlePubMed/NCBIGoogle Scholar34.Palacios-Ceña D, Albaladejo-Vicente R, Hernández-Barrera V, Lima-Florencio L, Fernández-de-Las-Peñas C, Jimenez-Garcia R, et al. 2021;12(1):22. pmid:33568220View ArticlePubMed/NCBIGoogle Scholar36.Alexander SN, Green AR, Debner EK, Ramos Freitas LE, Abdelhadi HMK, Szabo-Pardi TA, et al. 2024;15(1):82. pmid:39439003View ArticlePubMed/NCBIGoogle Scholar37.Geneen LJ, Moore RA, Clarke C, Martin D, Colvin LA, Smith BH. pmid:28087891View ArticlePubMed/NCBIGoogle Scholar38.Juan W, Rui L, Wei-Wen Z. pmid:32013565View ArticlePubMed/NCBIGoogle Scholar39.Informe técnico N°03. 2025;267:114594. pmid:40373579View ArticlePubMed/NCBIGoogle Scholar",
