      "text": "The main benefit of implementing AI in screen-reading might thus be related to increased sensitivity of the screening test.",
      "paperTitle": "How much radiologist time can be saved by implementing AI in screen-reading mammograms?",
      "doi": "10.1007/s00330-025-12273-x",
      "source": "openalex",
      "yearPublished": 2026,
